(card "exp:D-R1-1_consensus_gte1" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:D-R1-1_consensus_gte1"
  :body "---\nnav: 31\ntype: experiment\nid: D-R1-1_consensus_gte1\nshort_name: consensus_gte1\ntitle: \"D-R1-1 — anchor + post-filter keep lc_48h ≥ 1 (require external echo)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: d\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_d__blacklist_default_admit]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.0585\ntrain_trade_count: 18\ntrain_win_rate: 0.7778\ntrain_sharpe: 4.9651\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0096\nval_nav_mean: 1.0069\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0060\nval_window_count: 6\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 1\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [whitelist, cross_source]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/d, round/r1, axis/whitelist, axis/cross_source, status/falsified, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/small]\n---\n\n# D-R1-1 — anchor + keep lc_48h ≥ 1\n\n> **TL;DR** —— D-R1 系列 strict-whitelist 实验：anchor base + 只保留有 ≥1 个 cross-source echo (lc_48h ≥ 1) 的 leg。**train 仅 18 笔, NAV 1.06**（基本没赚），val 只 6 window —— **count_pass=False**。验证\"必须等别人 confirm 才进\"路线在 anchor pool 上 sample 太稀。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：要求 cross-source 至少 ≥1 echo = 信号被独立 source confirm 过的 leg 更可靠 → win 升 / NAV 升。\n- 期待：trade_count 砍一半（anchor 140 → 70），NAV 持平或升。\n- 实测：trade_count 砍到 18 —— anchor pool 大部分 leg 在 48h 内没有 cross-source echo，whitelist 过严。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- 步骤：anchor G2 → post-filter keep leg if `lc_48h >= 1`.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- `lc_48h` past-only (events `event_time < t`).\n- `#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.0585 | 18 | 4.97 | 77.8% | -0.96% |\n| Val (rolling 6w only) | 1.0069 ± 0.006 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN (count_fail) | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | -1.13 (FAIL) | -122 | -2.73 | -7.9pp | +0.05pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 1 (count_fail flag, statistical power 不足)。\n- 真实问题：whitelist 阈值 lc_48h ≥ 1 在 anchor pool 上过严 → 样本崩塌。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-2__isolated_keep]], [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-3__drop_full_consensus]]\n- **antithesis_of**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-3__drop_full_consensus]] (R1-1 keep ≥1，R1-3 drop ==2)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (D-R1-1)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **lesson**: cross-source consensus 在 alpha_second_v1 的 anchor pool 上**反向 useful** —— 反而是 \"drop 全 consensus\" (R1-3) / \"drop full crowd\" (D-R2-x) 在 train 上有些 NAV 提升（虽然 test 也崩）。\n- whitelist \"require external echo\" 这条路在 trade pool 不超 200 笔的尺度上**没有 statistical power**。下次类似 axis 应先 audit raw \"echo rate\" 分布。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-1__consensus_gte1.md"
